{"seq":8,"slug":"lc0024-swap-nodes-in-pairs","title":"LeetCode 24 两两交换链表中的节点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-string-linked-list/lc0024-swap-nodes-in-pairs","wordCount":759,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-24-两两交换链表中的节点\">LeetCode 24 两两交换链表中的节点</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给你一个链表，两两交换其中相邻的节点，并返回交换后链表的头节点。你必须在不修改节点内部值的情况下完成本题（即只能进行节点交换）。</p>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>head = [1,2,3,4]</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>[2,1,4,3]</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>head = []</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>[]</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>head = [1]</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>[1]</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>链表中节点的数目在范围 <code>[0, 100]</code> 内</li>\n<li><code>0 &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 100</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>本题要求真正交换节点而非交换值，这意味着必须正确操作指针。需要仔细处理每对节点的指针重连，避免断链。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><h3 id=\"递归思路\">递归思路</h3><p>递归解法非常优雅。对于每一对节点 <code>(first, second)</code>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>递归处理 <code>second.next</code> 及之后的链表，得到已交换好的子链表</li>\n<li>将 <code>second.next</code> 指向 <code>first</code></li>\n<li>将 <code>first.next</code> 指向递归返回的子链表头</li>\n<li>返回 <code>second</code> 作为交换后的头节点</li>\n</ol>\n<p>递归终止条件：链表为空或只剩一个节点时，无需交换，直接返回。</p>\n<h3 id=\"迭代思路\">迭代思路</h3><p>迭代解法需要一个前驱指针 <code>prev</code> 来连接已交换部分和当前交换对。每次操作一对节点 <code>(node1, node2)</code>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>保存 <code>node2.next</code>（下一对的起点）</li>\n<li><code>prev.next = node2</code>（前驱指向交换后的第一个节点）</li>\n<li><code>node2.next = node1</code>（第二个指向第一个）</li>\n<li><code>node1.next = saved</code>（第一个指向下一对的起点）</li>\n<li><code>prev = node1</code>（更新前驱为当前对的尾节点）</li>\n</ol>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>思路</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>递归</td>\n<td>自底向上交换</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n) 栈空间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迭代</td>\n<td>逐对交换 + 前驱指针</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><h3 id=\"方法一-递归\">方法一：递归</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class ListNode {&#10;  val: number;&#10;  next: ListNode | null;&#10;  constructor(val?: number, next?: ListNode | null) {&#10;    this.val = val ?? 0;&#10;    this.next = next ?? null;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;function swapPairs(head: ListNode | null): ListNode | null {&#10;  if (head === null || head.next === null) {&#10;    return head;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const first = head;&#10;  const second = head.next;&#10;&#10;  first.next = swapPairs(second.next);&#10;  second.next = first;&#10;&#10;  return second;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> swapPairs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">head</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (head </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> first</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> second</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  first.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> swapPairs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(second.next);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  second.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> first;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> second;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"方法二-迭代\">方法二：迭代</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function swapPairs(head: ListNode | null): ListNode | null {&#10;  const dummy = new ListNode(0, head);&#10;  let prev: ListNode = dummy;&#10;&#10;  while (prev.next !== null &amp;&amp; prev.next.next !== null) {&#10;    const node1 = prev.next;&#10;    const node2 = prev.next.next;&#10;&#10;    prev.next = node2;&#10;    node1.next = node2.next;&#10;    node2.next = node1;&#10;&#10;    prev = node1;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return dummy.next;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> swapPairs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">head</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dummy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, head);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dummy;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (prev.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev.next.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> node1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> node2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev.next.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prev.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    node1.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node2.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    node2.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prev </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dummy.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"指针变化图解\">指针变化图解</h3><p>以 <code>[1,2,3,4]</code> 为例，展示迭代法第一轮的指针操作：</p>\n<p><strong>交换前：</strong> <code>dummy → 1 → 2 → 3 → 4</code></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>指针变化</th>\n<th>链表状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>prev.next = node2</td>\n<td>dummy → 2</td>\n<td>dummy → 2, 1 → 2 → 3 → 4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>node1.next = node2.next</td>\n<td>1 → 3</td>\n<td>dummy → 2, 1 → 3 → 4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>node2.next = node1</td>\n<td>2 → 1</td>\n<td>dummy → 2 → 1 → 3 → 4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>prev = node1</td>\n<td>prev 移至 1</td>\n<td>准备下一轮</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>交换后：</strong> <code>dummy → 2 → 1 → 3 → 4</code></p>\n<p>第二轮从 <code>prev = 1</code> 开始，交换 <code>3</code> 和 <code>4</code>，最终得到 <code>dummy → 2 → 1 → 4 → 3</code>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"递归展开过程\">递归展开过程</h3><p>以 <code>[1,2,3,4]</code> 为例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"swapPairs([1,2,3,4])&#10;  first=1, second=2&#10;  first.next = swapPairs([3,4])&#10;                first=3, second=4&#10;                first.next = swapPairs(null) → null&#10;                second.next = 3&#10;                return 4  → [4,3]&#10;  first.next = [4,3]  → 1 → 4 → 3&#10;  second.next = 1      → 2 → 1 → 4 → 3&#10;  return 2  → [2,1,4,3]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>swapPairs([1,2,3,4])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  first=1, second=2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  first.next = swapPairs([3,4])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                first=3, second=4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                first.next = swapPairs(null) → null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                second.next = 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                return 4  → [4,3]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  first.next = [4,3]  → 1 → 4 → 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  second.next = 1      → 2 → 1 → 4 → 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return 2  → [2,1,4,3]</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>递归</th>\n<th>迭代</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n)，每个节点处理一次</td>\n<td>O(n)，每个节点处理一次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n)，递归栈深度 n/2</td>\n<td>O(1)，仅需常数指针</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>时间复杂度详解：</strong> 两种方法都精确地遍历链表一次，每对节点执行常数次指针操作。对于 n 个节点，共 n/2 对，总操作 O(n)。</p>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度详解：</strong> 递归方法的栈深度为 n/2（每次递归处理一对），即 O(n)。迭代方法只使用 <code>dummy</code>、<code>prev</code>、<code>node1</code>、<code>node2</code> 四个指针，空间 O(1)。在面试中，如果面试官关注空间复杂度，应选择迭代解法。</p>\n<p>本题是链表指针操作的经典训练题。核心技能是理解「修改指针顺序的正确性」——必须保证在断开某个连接之前，已经保存了需要的引用。这个技能可以推广到 K 个一组翻转链表（LC #25）。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 24 两两交换链表中的节点","id":"leetcode-24-两两交换链表中的节点"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":3,"text":"递归思路","id":"递归思路"},{"level":3,"text":"迭代思路","id":"迭代思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":3,"text":"方法一：递归","id":"方法一-递归"},{"level":3,"text":"方法二：迭代","id":"方法二-迭代"},{"level":3,"text":"指针变化图解","id":"指针变化图解"},{"level":3,"text":"递归展开过程","id":"递归展开过程"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 19 删除链表的倒数第 N 个结点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-string-linked-list/lc0019-remove-nth-node-from-end"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 61 旋转链表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-string-linked-list/lc0061-rotate-list"}}